{"T1":{"blocks":[{"key":"chchs","text":"Matched to you. Picked for your brief.","type":"header-three","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"6866v","text":"These are chosen from what you have clicked, saved and asked me about. Not what fits? Update your requirements at the bottom and next Monday gets sharper.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}}],"entityMap":{}},"T2":{"blocks":[{"key":"wjw5c","text":"Why use a buyers agent. Someone on your side.","type":"header-three","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"cmflo","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"z2vqv","text":"1. Everyone else is paid by the seller.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":39,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"pufbc","text":"The listing agent, the stager, the photographer. You are the only person in the room without representation.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"dzoxf","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"514yd","text":"2. I see homes before they are advertised.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":42,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"fthq8","text":"Off market, pre launch, and the ones that quietly come back after a campaign stalls.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"0gec5","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"8pfsg","text":"3. I know what the house down the road actually sold for.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":57,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"wev40","text":"Not the portal estimate. The number, the terms, and why it went that way.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"wmili","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"4zgpg","text":"How it works","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":12,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"89cb4","text":"01. We talk about what you are after and what you can do.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"w51tu","text":"02. I send you what fits, including homes you will not find on Trade Me.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"mupu8","text":"03. When you find it, I negotiate it.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"ydme0","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"zqyk0","text":"It costs you nothing. I am paid from the seller side of the transaction, so you get representation without a fee.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":21,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}}],"entityMap":{}},"T3":{"blocks":[{"key":"kxohc","text":"Do you know the process? Five steps, and how to be the buyer they say yes to.","type":"header-three","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"3cnqe","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"y8gv1","text":"1. Pre approval, not pre qualification. A real pre approval from a broker, in writing, with the conditions spelt out. It tells me how hard we can push.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":39,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"igssk","text":"2. Shortlist. I send what fits, you tell me what lands. We go and look, early and often.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":13,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"zzjit","text":"3. Due diligence before the offer. Builders report, LIM, title, body corporate if there is one, lawyer across the contract. Done before you commit, not after.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":34,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"xilp8","text":"4. The offer. Written on the Sale and Purchase Agreement, priced to the evidence, with as few conditions as you can safely carry.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":13,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"uevjo","text":"5. Unconditional and settlement. Deposit paid, finance confirmed, keys on settlement day. Insurance in place from the moment you go unconditional.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":32,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"8bh7q","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"sbprw","text":"Strengthen your position. A clean offer wins against a bigger one more often than you would think.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":25,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"gvrvg","text":"Fewer conditions. Every clause is a reason for the vendor to pick someone else. Do the work up front so you can offer with a short finance clause, or none.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":17,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"i22mx","text":"Deposit ready. Ten percent sitting in the right account on the day. Cash in hand beats a bigger number with strings on it.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":14,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"l69fo","text":"Settlement that suits them. Ask what date the vendor wants. Matching it costs you nothing and often wins the deal.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":27,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"eybz2","text":"Lawyer briefed early. Your solicitor has the title and the contract before you offer, so there is no delay when the vendor says yes.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":21,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"b0y9a","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"b087t","text":"Want me to look over your offer before it goes in? Hit the button below.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}}],"entityMap":{}},"T4":{"blocks":[{"key":"i2m0y","text":"My little black book. Who I send my buyers to.","type":"header-three","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"fpwvi","text":"Getting the finance and the inspection right is half the deal. These are the people I pick up the phone to, and who pick up when I call. Tap a name to email them, a number to call, or a firm to see their site.","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"4swsf","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"k4crs","text":"Mortgage brokers","type":"header-three","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}}],"entityMap":{}},"T5":{"blocks":[{"key":"fdba7","text":"Peimin Huang, Squirrel","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":12,"style":"BOLD"}],"entityRanges":[{"offset":14,"length":8,"key":0}],"data":{}},{"key":"6jmoo","text":"021 783 431 · peimin@squirrel.co.nz","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[{"offset":0,"length":11,"key":1},{"offset":14,"length":21,"key":2}],"data":{}},{"key":"lxyi7","text":"","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[],"entityRanges":[],"data":{}},{"key":"uhtev","text":"David Green, AdviceHQ","type":"unstyled","depth":0,"inlineStyleRanges":[{"offset